  "boundary_evidence": {
    "description": "The resource map identifies PACK 5 at offset $1CF2E with 4190 body bytes. Its eight-byte block starts at $1CF26 and declares 4198 bytes, ending at $1DF8C. The surviving driver includes Elems68K1, Elems68K2, Elems68K3 and Elems68KC in exactly that order. Their complete contents match the ROM after restoring package locking and instruction encodings. The final ATANP coefficients end at the resource boundary.",
